Z||000020||terryk||07-07-2000||09:58 PM||||LowCG,<P>FI has the same *equivalents* as the carb. Just tons more control. Learn the FI stuff. You will be miles ahead and anything you learned on carbs will apply and be useful.<P>Taijiguy, <P>When you don't have anymore use for the ADS chip, let me borrow it for a day so I can see what the calibrations are.<BR><p>[This message has been edited by terryk (edited 07-07-2000).]||||reg||1
